    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26938" root="طلع" body-key="T">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طلّع</span></b>  said of the palm-tree: see 1, former
half. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طلّعهُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَطْلِيعٌ</span>, meaning <i>He put it
forth,</i> or <i>produced it,</i> is a vulgar word. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طلّع كَيْلَهُ</span>, inf. n. as above, (assumed tropical:)  <i>He filled his
measure.</i> (O, K.)

